direction: down

start: 요구사항 도착 {shape: oval}
interview: "1. interview-me\n의도 확정"
spec: "2. spec-writer\ndocs/spec/ 스펙 작성"
gate1: 스펙 승인 {
  shape: diamond
  style.fill: "#f9e2af"
}
plan: "3. task-breakdown\ndocs/plan/ 계획 작성"
gate2: 계획 승인 {
  shape: diamond
  style.fill: "#f9e2af"
}
exec: "4. plan-executor\n서브에이전트 위임 실행"
verify: "5. spec-conformance-check\n스펙 적합성 독립 검증"
review: "6. review 3종 병렬\n품질 · 보안 · 성능"
done: 완료 {shape: oval}
adr1: "adr-writer\nADR Proposed 작성" {style.fill: "#cba6f7"}
adr2: "adr-writer\nADR Accepted 확정" {style.fill: "#cba6f7"}

start -> interview: 모호함
start -> spec: 명확함
interview -> spec
spec -> gate1
gate1 -> spec: 반려
gate1 -> plan: 승인
plan -> gate2
gate2 -> plan: 반려
gate2 -> exec: 승인
gate2 -> adr1: 되돌리기 비싼\n결정 포함 시 {style.stroke-dash: 3}
exec -> verify
verify -> plan: FAIL {style.stroke: "#C5221F"}
verify -> review: PASS
verify -> adr2: PASS {style.stroke-dash: 3}
review -> plan: 수정 필요 {style.stroke: "#C5221F"}
review -> done: 통과
